        "z": "34a438ba0fa6a764",
        "name": "function 19",
        "func": "\n// 2. Add the trigger topic\n// This tells the next Function node: \"Stop buffering and send the file!\"\nmsg.topic = \"RELEASE_FILE\";\n\n// 3. Optional: Clear the payload so it doesn't get mixed with SCL data\nmsg.payload = true; \n\n// 4. Send this message into the same input as your file chunks\nreturn msg;\n",
